WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.217 --> 00:00:02.784
- Good morning, Believe Nation,
my name is Evan Carmichael.

00:00:02.784 --> 00:00:05.681
My one word is believe and
I believe that entrepreneurs

00:00:05.681 --> 00:00:08.124
will solve all of the
world's major problems.

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:09.508
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:12.533
today's message is pursue your passion.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.111
Over to you, Kevin O'Leary.

00:00:14.111 --> 00:00:16.415
